Flash-MX
========

Flash-MX is derived from Flash-X (https://github.com/Flash-X/Flash-X),
starting from Flash-X commit ad45147f5. It retains the Flash-X
infrastructure and the incompressible multiphase flow capabilities. The
version-control history of the retained files is preserved with its
original authorship; commit identifiers differ from those in Flash-X
because the history was filtered.

This distribution has been modified relative to Flash-X: the compressible
hydrodynamics, equation of state, gravity, radiation transport, spacetime,
burn, deleptonization and stirring physics units, the setups, tests and
libraries that depend on them, and all site configurations other than the
container site have been removed. The modifications are recorded in the
git history of this repository.

